{
  "Name": "EDA-methane-detection",
  "Title": "Methane Detection",
  "CollectionGroup": "Detection",
  "Themes": [
    "carbon-accounting"
  ],
  "Tags": [
    "Methane Emissions Analysis"
  ],
  "Description": "<img width=\"30%\" src=\"https://gtif-ukif.github.io/gtif-ukif-client/assets/EDA-logo.png\">\n\nTime-series of the average amount of methane in the signal region relative to the background region, over the selected AOI and time range.\n\n<hr>\n\n<strong>Disclaimer</strong><br>Methane detections represent potential emission indicators derived from satellite data. They are not validated measurements and do not imply health risk, safety concerns, or regulatory non-compliance.",
